# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Contact form endpoint. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in ONE value below.
# Until it is set, the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client —
# it never silently drops a lead, but nothing is delivered automatically.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# The form POSTs JSON: { name, prenom, email, message, website }
# (`website` is the spam honeypot — always empty for real visitors.)

# ── Option A — no backend, no deploy (fastest) ───────────────────────────────
# Create a form at https://formspree.io or https://web3forms.com and paste the
# URL they give you. Works on any static host.
#
#   VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID

# ── Option B — use the bundled serverless function (api/contact.js) ──────────
# Deploy on Vercel, Netlify or Cloudflare, then set on the HOST (not here):
#   RESEND_API_KEY=...           from https://resend.com
#   CONTACT_TO=contact@asbizdev.com
#   CONTACT_FROM="AS Biz Dev <no-reply@asbizdev.com>"
# and point the front end at your own route:
#
#   VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=/api/contact

VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
